  "id": "ex-11-wechselpraepositionen-a2",
  "intro": "Standalone drill set, not tied to any lesson. Nine prepositions — in, an, auf, über, unter, vor, hinter, neben, zwischen — can take either Dativ or Akkusativ, depending on the question: Wo? (location, no movement) → Dativ; Wohin? (movement into/onto/toward a place) → Akkusativ. The verb is the giveaway: stehen/liegen/hängen/sitzen describe a resulting state (Wo? → Dativ), while stellen/legen/hängen/setzen describe the movement that creates it (Wohin? → Akkusativ). Blocks: A Basistraining → B Vertiefung → C Sprachbausteine → D Wiederholung. Answers in solutions.md.\n",
  "lesson": "EX/11-wechselpraepositionen-a2",
  "level": "A2",
  "summary": null,
  "title": "Wechselpräpositionen: Wo? und Wohin? — A2",
